<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Lamma:</book>
  <para style="h2">Koranti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus sẽkoo au pɛsɛyɛ yɛnɛ shɔ Koranti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korinti</para>
  <para style="toc3">3 Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ Korinti</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus sẽkoo au pɛsiyɛ yɛnɛ shɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Koranti,</para>
  <para style="imt">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">Bulus sẽkoo au pɛsiyɛ yɛnɛ shɔ Koranti i ɗɔbiiyɛ, bee sẽkoom aru gbete u yukɔnɛ siɗɔn a gãsi shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗabii a Korantini. Gãsi shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗabii i sha vikɔ̃linɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm au kaka aɗɔn a Bulus yuuni nɛu ɓa jashonɛ tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, ama Bulus tasiyi ɔrinɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm nɛi ɓasinaatɔ a tasiu yɛti puru ntanɛ sɔ̃ntɔ waanɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">A sẽkoom u gɨn-gɨn gaanɛ Bulus tadɔɔ ruu gbete ɓasiyi a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabiitɔ fɛ̃ɛm, a vigbete pɔ̃urɛ tasi shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ biyi raayɛ, aru u ɔ̃nɛ i shɔnɔpɔ̃ni, kɛɗɔn nta sisɨn purutɔ gbete n-tirɛ yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛ a naɓasinɛ a shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗabiini. Kɛɗɔn gaki shɔ sisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗabiirɛ nɛi toliyi vina ãnɛnɛ gbete yɛ n ti Urushalimayɛ, aru Bulus yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa sẽnɛnɛ ɓa yɛ ai i ɗɔbiitɔ aruviya i pɔ̃si Kirisa shɔraayi naatɔ. A laabeenɛm nakunɛ Bulus rau yuu a shɔ Koranti i naa ayuu ruu gbete shɔmala nyayeelinɛyi i sha au yuu nɛu ɓa jashonɛ tɔ̃vɨn ɓayɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-11)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bulus a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi a Korinti (1.12-7.16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kirisayi viãnɛ a Judiya (8.1-9.15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bulus rauyuu au ɔ̃nɛ jashonɛ(10.1-13.10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (13.11-13)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Sẽkooum shɛ ang ɗɔbii Bulus, nkɔ ɔ̃rɛ Yesɔ Kirisi jashonɛ au lɔyɛ, a Ɗalapa kasinɛ, wɔsɔ̃n u ɓɛzɔ̃ Timoti gee ɔ nyatɛjo a Kɔrantini</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Ɔ shɔsisɨn-ãnɛ Ɗabii, a Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi a tipi Akaya ni kpai:<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Mɛnɛ Ɗalapa U Ɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kirisi u ãwɔ ɔ̃nɛ Ɗa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />U dɔ̃ri Ɗalapanɛ gbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi Ɓeye, u pɛ Uɓeye au ntashɔratɔyɛ, Ɗalapa gbete pɔ̃si shɔ naa a vi kpaiyɛ! <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Yɛ pɔ̃siunaatɔ au ɓuzɨn raɓooni kpai, aru u kpaa kaka nɔgbete u yɛ pɔ̃si shɔwɔyi naa jo ai ɓuzɨn raɓoonɛ tottot, u pɛli vishonɛ jo a naapɔ̃sinɛ gbete u kpaa a Ɗalapa ɗɔbiiyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Ji nagbete u ɗɔ raɓoonɛ nagbete Kirisi au yuu ɓooyɛ, sɔ̃nji nanko a Kirisi kabiikɔ u kpaa Ɗalapa naapɔ̃sinɛ pẽnibarɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Ukɛ ɓooranɛ, pɛ jo aru ɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ a naraanɛni a ruuvinikɔ; shɔkɛ pɔ̃siunaa nɛ, ɔkɔɔma ɔ kpaa naapɔ̃sinɛtɛ nɔgbete ɔ kpaa kaka ɔ masisɨn ɔ ɔ̃ a sisɨnmɛɛnɛ nagbete u masisɨn u ɓoorayɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ji nankɔ u sisɨn-pɔ̃nɛ awɔ bi u kaka aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, u zɛ tɛttɔ nɔgbete ɔ kpaa raɓoonɛ aru raa gbete u ɓooyɛ, ɔkɔɔma ɔ kpaa naapɔ̃nɛtɔ gbete u kpaayɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />N shɔbiiyi a nyaba Kirisi n kasi n kparɔɔ sisɨntɔ, aru raɓoonɛ gbete u ɓooyɛ a tipi Asiya. Raɓoonɛ gbete si au yuu tɛɛkakatɔ waanɛ, si pɛ̃niba u ji pɔ̃ sisɨn ɓa nɛu yɛ ɔ̃ a suruni ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />U nta au bi naa shɔ yeeruutɛ nɛ shɔu nyoutɔ. Ama vim pɛlinankɔ aru nɛ ukɔ pɔ̃ sisɨn nɛ au bi, u pɔ̃ sisɨn a Ɗalapa bi, shɔu yusi shɔ gbeteyi vɔtɛttɔ lapayɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ɗalapa shɛshiutɛ a vɔrɔ kɔ̃linɛ pɛ̃nibam naani, rautɛ, yɛ rau sɔ̃ntɔ; u pɔ̃sisɨntɛ au biini nɛ yɛ rau sɔ̃ntɔ tɔkɨn, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Ɔ pɔ̃siunaatɔ a Ɗa gakinɛni, aru nankɔ shɔkɛ gaki Ɗa nɛ waanɛ au yuu Ɗalapa yɛ tɛttɔ, Ɗalapa yɛ tasiu vɔɔ susãritɔ a biini; kɛɗɔn shɔzɛ waanɛ i yɛ ɗee yeenya i dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa au yuu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Kɔsi Sisɨn aru vigbete mayɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Vi gbete au pɔ̃rɛ u waanaa a nɔsisɨnyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔm, u vigbete u lɛri a sisɨn tasitɛ nɛ u ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a kotipimni, nɔgbete u ɔ̃nɛ a ɔkɔɔniyɛ, Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ nɛu pɛli vitɔ̃vɨng a shɔ nɔɔ a sisɨn gbete, a kaka gbete shɛ a ka Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ ama ɓa a shɔzɛ sẽrẽ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13-14" />U beerɔɔ pɛ vi gbete ɔ ɓaliyɛ ɔ zɛyɛkɔ sheeli, ama dɔdɔrim ɔ zɛ pɛ ɓa fɛ̃ɛ, n pɔ̃sisɨntɛ ɔ yɛ zɛ vigbete u shayɛtɔ piti kpaini, nɗa lee gbete Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kaanɛyɛ ɔ yɛ waanɔsisɨntɔ au yuuni nagbete u waanɔsisɨn awɔ yuuyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />N zɛ vim tɛttɔ piti kpai, n marɛ n-tɔ n gaapɛ ɔ ɗɔbii yɛnɛ, a nɔgbete ɔ kpaa Ɗa vɔɔ susãri tasinɛ ɓa ziti, <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Aru n marɛ n-tɛ n awɔ ɗɔbii ang yaɓa yɛnɛ Makidoniya, a nɔgbete n yɛn kpaa naapɔ̃sinɛ awɔ ɗɔbii aru n yɛnɛ tipi Yahudiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />A ɗɔng n mavimyɛ ɔ zɛnaa n kɔsin sisɨntɔ ya? Naa nkɛ mang vinɛ, ɔ zɛnaa n ma vi naa shɔkotipiyi ya? Aru i kasinyanɛ, nn, ama ai sisɨn ɓa ukɔ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nyamasinɛ ɓa, ji nagbete Ɗalapa sha vitɔ̃vɨng-yɛ, ruu gbete n ma awɔ yuuyɛ ɓa shɔ gbete shɔ ɓaanɛ &lt;&lt;Nn&gt;&gt; ko shɔ ɓaanɛ &lt;&lt;Ɓa&gt;&gt; ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Aru Ɗa jaa Yesɔ Kirisi yuu, shɔgbete Sila a Timoti ang yuu u nwari shɔ Ɗanyarubii awɔ tete, u ɓa shɔ gbete kasinya nɛ &lt;&lt;Nn&gt;&gt; a &lt;&lt;Ɓa&gt;&gt; ɓa, ama kopiɗaviya u ɓɛɛ ɓɛɛjo &lt;&lt;Nn&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />A ruukɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ &lt;&lt;nn&gt;&gt; a vigbete Ɗalapa mayɛ piti kpai. Aruumkɔ a Yesɔ Kirisi kabii u &lt;&lt;Nankɔ&gt;&gt;U sha aru Ɗalapa bassinɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Ji Ɗalapa au yuu ukɔ shɛshiurɛ a ɔkɔɔni, zɛ tɛttɔ Suru kpaanɛ aɗɔn ukɛ ɓasiyuunɛ a kirisiniyɛ; ji Ɗalapa au yuu ukɔ lɔurɛ, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />pɔ̃ vitasinɛtɛ ayuu, shɔgbete ãu Ɗa surutɛ au sisɨn, aru u tasiu vigbete yɛ pɛliu a ɗekɨn yɛ.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Ɗalapa kɔ ɔ̃rɛ n shɔ shinɛkɨnti, zɛn sisɨn tɛttɔ! N ji sɔɔ tipi koranti ɓa aru gbete n yɛn pɔ̃ ɔ raɓoonɛrɛ tɔkɨn. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />U ji tɔɓanɛ u tasɔɔ kaka nɛ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ a vigbete ɔ ãsisɨn a ɗɔnniyɛ ɓa, u zɛ tɛttɔ ɔ shitɛ a dɔkaziti a sisɨn ãnɛni, ama u pɛlivishonɛ a ɔkɔɔni aru ɔ nta sisɨn puru.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Arumkɔ n pɔ̃ a sisɨn n-tɔ n yɛn awɔ ɗɔbii toti n pɔ̃wɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛrɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Aru nkɛ pɔ̃wɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛnɛ, kɛpiyɛ pɔ̃rɛ n suru u nta tɔ̃vɨn piya? Ama shɔ gbete n pɔ̃rɛ u sisɨn lɛsiyɛkɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Aruukɔ n beerɔɔ sẽkoowarɛ, n ji kasiɓa n a shɔ gbete tɔ̃tɔ i pɔ̃ng sisɨn puru, i lɛsing sisɨnrɛ ɓa. aruviya n zɛtɛ nkɛ ɔ̃nɛ a ɓuzɨn sisɨn puru ɔkɔɔma ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ ji a ɓuzɨn sisɨn purukɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />N beerɔɔ rɛ sin a ɓuzɨn raɓoonɛ a sisɨn hɨmrini, a muruni nɔɔ fɛ̃ɛm, n pɛli nankɔ ɓanɛ ɔ sisɨn u lɛsitɔ ɓa, ama aru u pɔ̃wɔrɛ ɔ zɛ nɔgbete n ɔrɔɔyɛ piti kpai.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Yaasi Shɔ Gbete Pɛlaa Ruuvinitɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Naa shɔu kɛ pɔ̃ shɔwɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛ nɛ, ji pɛli ɓa nkɔ ɓa ama pɛli jo ɔkɔɔ piti kpai. N sha vim ɓanɛ aru u ɔ̃rɔɔ yukɔnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Ayuu jamkɔ ratasinɛ gbete awɔ shɔ gãsiyi i tasiuyɛ teesitɛ nankɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Dɔdɔrim anɔgbete ɔ tasiu raayɛ ɔ yasiu ruuvini ɔ masiubiitɔ, nɔgbete u sisɨn hɨmri yɛ tɛu kaka ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Arumkɔ n gaki ɔtɔ ɔ tasiunɛ ɔ ɔriutɔ fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />N beerɔɔ sẽkoom aru n ntawɔ sisɨn pɛ, n zɛkɨn ko ɔ bimanɛ a ɗɔnnya, kopiɗaviya ɔ gɨn n nya-ãsinɛ kati ya. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Naa ɔ kɛ yaasi shɔ ruuvini nɛ, aru vigbeteyi pɛliyɛni, n kɔma n yaasiyi ruuvinitɛ jo, aru nkɛ yaasi shɔ ruuvininɛ, kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn, naa nkɛ kasi shɔ ruuvini yaasinɛ kpai awɔ yuu n pɛli a Kirisi ɗekɨn, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />Aru japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ ukɔu kpaa kaka gbete yɛ shau kakabiyɛnɛ, aru u zɛ tɛttɔ kopileepiya u ɗɔ gbete kã nyaba nɛu sãu yuuyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Yuyɔrinɛ a Toruwasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Naa n to Toruwasitɛ aru n nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a Kirisi yuu, N kpaarɛ Uɓeyelapa ɓeli nyaba vishonɛtɛ a ɗɔuni. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Ama n yɔriyuu fɛ̃ɛm aru n ji kpaa mazɔ Titus ɓa a ɗɔnni ɓa. Aruukɔ n vasi shɔ nyarɛ, ang tɛɛrɛ yanɛ Makidoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗasharinɛ a Ɓuzɨn Kirisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />N dɔ̃ri Ɗalapatɛ! Au tɛsiu ɗekɨn kopileepiya Ɗashariutɔ a Kirisi kabii naa shɔjahmyi. Ɗalapa pɛli vishonɛ a ukɔni aru u sãti Kirisi ruubii kopiɗɔpiya naa nɔsũrũ au sɛ̃ɛ̃ tɔ̃vɨn shɔ ɓaanɛ tulari. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />U pɛ naa tulari au sɛ̃ɛ̃ tɔ̃vɨn gbete Kirisi ã Ɗalapayɛ, ama u shɔ gbete Kirisi raautɛyɛ u sɛ̃ɛ̃ sũrũ-sũrũ n ti suru a shɔ gbeteyi a nyaba vɔnɛyɛ u sɛ̃ɛ̃ kɔ̃linɛ. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />A shɔ gbeteyi a nyaba vɔnɛyɛ, sɛ̃ɛ̃m pɛ sɛ̃ɛ vɔrɔ, ama shɔ gbete ai ranaatɛ, sɛ̃ɛm pɛ sɛ̃ɛ gbete n ti sururɛ, pi zɛnɔɔ vishonɛn kɛpiya? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />U ɓa naa shɔwɔyi ɓa, shɔ gbeteyi nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubii aru i kpaa viwɔ a yuuni. Ama aru Ɗalapa shoupɛrɛ, u nwanya a sisɨn gbete au ɗekɨn, naa shɔ gbeteyi sho vishonɛ Ɗalapayɛ.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Jɛwɛrɛ Ruumanɛ Sɔɔyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Vim tasi naa u baasi sɔ̃nkɛ au yuu ya? u kãkɛ sẽkoo u yutasinɛ yɛnɛ ɔ ɗɔbiininya ko awɔ na ya? nagbete shɔwɔyi shayɛ ya? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃rɛ sẽkooyi gbete u a wuniyɛ, gbete shɔ bee au sisɨn aru kopiya u zɛrɛ u ɓalitɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Vim a ɓili weze nɛ Kirisi bee sẽkoomrɛ a shorɛ au kaabii. Shɔ bee tɛtɔ shɔ ji bee ɓa a laavi beenɛ ɓa ama a Ɗalapa Suru, shɔ ji bee ɓa a yutari ɓa ama a shɔzɛ sisɨn.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />U sha vim aru u sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗalapa biini a Kirisi kabii. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Viwɔ ɓau bini ɓa au yɛ tasi nɛ, u kaka vishonɛm pɛlinɛtɔ ɗɔnɓa. U kaka vishonɛm shɛpɛ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii; <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Pɛjo ukɔ pɔ̃urɛ u gɨn ruumanɛ sɔɔmrɛ, ɓa Musa nya-ãsinɛ gbete shɔ beeyɛ ɓa ama Ɗa suru. Nya-ãsinɛ gbete shɔ beeyɛ ukɔ n-tiu vɔnɛrɛ, ama Ɗa suru n-tiu Suru kpaanɛ.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Nya-ãsinɛ shɔ bee a tari vibeenɛ, ama Ɗalapa bassinɛ shɛtɔ a ɗagbete shɔ ãyɛni. Ko Musa nɔkɨn gbete kɔliyɛ yɛ ɗɔɔtɔ, u kolinɛu kaka siɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm nɔgbete shɔ Israilayi i yɛ kɨnnɔɔ dɔɔɓa au nɔkɨn ni ɓa. Naa nya-ãsinɛ gbete n ti vɔnɛ kaanɛ a kakani, a abassinɛni, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />kɛɗɔn bassinɛ gbete Ɗa suru n-tiyɛ u banɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ kepikoviya? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Naa vishonɛ gbete n ti vɔrɔ, kpaa basinɛtɛ, kɛɗɔn vishonɛ gbeteyi n ti shɔraanɛ u banɛ yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpikoviya! <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Nizɛ kɔ vigbete u bassi aɗɔn a kɨntiyɛ u bassinɛ dɔdɔrim ɓa. shɔ ɓasi ɓa a bassinɛ pɛ̃niba vishonɛ ruumanɛ sɔɔni ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Naa vi gbete yɛ sɔ̃nyatɔ u bassinɛ aɗɔn dɔdɔrim, yɛ ɔ̃ kɛpikovi a bassinɛ gbete yɛ ɔ̃ dangdang ni viya!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Aru gbete u sisɨn pɔ̃nɛn a ɗɔnni, u kaka bimanɛ aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />U ɓa naa Musa ɓa, au kuki nɔkɨn a jafãrã nɛ aru Shɔ Israila i yɛ zɛ ɗɔɔnɛ bassinɛ gbete sɔ̃nyam-rɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ama i sisɨn lakitɛttɔ, anɛ dɔdɔrim i sisɨn kuki tɛttɔ a jãfãrãu ni naa shɔkɛ ɓali laabeenɛ ruumanɛ gbaalinɛ yɛ. Jafãrãm shɔ zɔ̃u dɔɔ ɓa seetɛ shɔ ɓasi shɔutɛ a Kirisini. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Anɛ nɛm shɔkɛ ɓali laabeenɛ Musanɛ jafãrãu kukiyi sisɨntɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Ama shɔ zɛnɔɔ zɔ̃nɛtɔ, nagbete Ɗanyaruubii sha a Musa yuu nɛ: &lt;&lt;U jafãrãu shɔyɛ zɛnɔɔ zɔ̃nɛtɔ naa u sisɨn kɛ sɔɔnɛ a Uɓeyelapa biini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Dɔdɔrim a ruumkɔ &lt;&lt;Uɓeyelapa&gt;&gt; ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗa suru. A ɗɔgbete Uɓeyelapa suru kɛ ɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn, ɔ̃nɛ yuu ji ɗɔwakɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />U piti kpai u pɛ shɔgbeteyi ã sisɨntɛ a Ɗabiiyɛ, u tasi pɛ Uɓeyelapa bassinɛ au nɔkɨn nyesiyini, sɔ̃nji basinɛmkɔ au shɛ a Uɓeyelapa ɗɔbii, shɔgbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗa suru, ukɔ kɔsiurɛ u naa Kirisi.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ a ɓuzɨn sisɨn-ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Ɗalapa au tete raa-ntanɛ ãu vishonɛmtɛ nɛu pɛlitɔ, aruukɔ ukɔu nyɔsisɨnnɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />U sɨn viɗɔɓusinɛtɛ a viyusẽni kpai kagbete; u pɛlivishonɛ ɓa a ruu shɔ ɗakinɛni ɓa, ko u kɔsi Ɗalapa nyaruubii gbete shɔ beeyɛ ɓa. U ɔ̃ a ɗɔsẽsẽ a Ɗalapa kabii u bɛli kopiyatɔ aru vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛni. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Aruviya ruu tɔ̃vɨn shɔkɛ ɓusinɛtɔ, shɔ ɓusi ɓɛɛjo a shɔ gbeteyi niiyɛ i nɔɔkɔ sheeli. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />I ji ã sisɨn ɓa Ɗabiini ɓa, aruviya ɗalapa kotipim japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ pɔ̃yi sisɨn tɛttɔ a ɗɔkɨnri, zãriyi ɗɔsẽsẽ zɛnɛ gbete koli ai biiyɛ tɛttɔ, ɗɔsẽsẽ gbete au shɛ aka ruu tɔ̃vɨn Kirisi basinɛyɛ, shɔmkɔ ɔ̃rɛ nɔgbete Ɗalapa ɔ̃yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Aruviya u nwari shɔ ɓa u ruubii ɓa; u nwari shɔ ɓɛɛ ruu Yesɔ Kirisi Uɓeyelapa, u ɓɛɛ naa ɔ fooyi aru Yesɔ yuu. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ɗlapa au shanɛ, &lt;&lt;Ɗɔsẽsẽ u kolipɛ a ɗɔkɨnri!&gt;&gt; Ji Ɗalapa gbetenkɔ pɔ̃u ɗɔsẽsẽrɛ koli au sisɨn, aru u pɔ̃rɛ shɔu zɛ Ɗalapa bassinɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ kɔlinɛ a Kirisi nɔkɨn.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />A shɔmni kpai shɔ gbete u visuru a ɗɔnim ama u naa ɓari tɔ̃pɔ̃ gbãgbã weze, aruviya u tasinɛ kaka gbete sɔ̃nyaɓa pɛ Ɗalapa ɓɛɛyɛ, ɓau ɓɛɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />U ɓooraa a lee-lee, ama shɔji mɛuɓa; ɗaleewɔ u sisɨn vãtɔ ziti, ama u sisɨn shɛ ɓa ɗɔmɓa; <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />U shɔnɔpɔ̃yi aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, ama ji leriu wesa pɛlinɛɓa; ko shɔ ntariu norɔ̃ɔ̃tɛ a leewɔni, shɔ lɛsiuɓa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Kopiɗaviya u tuu Yesɔ vɔnɛtɔ au bi, nɔgbete shɔu zɛu suru au biiyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Kɔpi leepiya u ɔ̃nɛ a nyaba vɔnɛ aru Yesɔ yuu, aruviya shɔu zɛu surutɔ au bi shɔzɛni. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Vimkɔ tasitɛ nɛ vɔrɔ a ɗɔgbete shovi au biiyɛ, ama suru ɓɛɛ jo a ɗɔvishonɛ awɔ biini.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ɗanyaruubii shanɛ, &lt;&lt;N nwanya aru gbete n ã sisɨntɛttɔ.&gt;&gt; A suru sisɨn ãnɛ gbetenkɔ, u nwanya kɛkn jo aru gbete u ã sisɨntɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />U zɛ tɛttɔ Ɗalapa gbete yusi Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ a suruni, yɛ yusiu sɔ̃njo a Yesɔni u tuurɛ a mokɔni yɛnɛu ɗekɨn. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Shɔm kpai shɔ pɛli ji awɔ yuukɔ; naa Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ kɛ shanɛ a shɔzɛ bi waanɛ yɛnɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn, i yɛ gaki Ɗatɔ bang aru Ɗalapa bassinɛ a dɔ̃rinɛni.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ a Nyaba Sisɨn ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Aru nankɔ u sisɨn ji vɔɓa. Ko u bi a ɗɔɔ pũnɛ lɛmlɛm, ama u suru ɓɛɛjo a ɗɔkɔsinɛ ko-pi leeshɔpiya. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Jaa raaɓoonɛ au ɔ̃ ɓa dangdang ɓam, shɔgbete u a ɗɔɔɓoonɛyɛ yɛ n-tiu bassinɛ pɛ̃niba gbete sɔ̃nyaɓatɔ, u tɛɛ raaɓoonɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Aru u pɔ̃ sisɨn ɓa ayuu vigbete u nɔɔ zɛyɛɓa, ama a yuu vigbete nɔɔ zɛ ɓayɛ. Vigbete shɔ zɛyɛ ɔ̃ɓa dangdang ɓa, ama vigbete nɔɔ zɛ ɓayɛ ɔ̃ dangdang.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Dɔdɔrim u zɛ tɛttɔ naa u jazɛ bi gbete a kotipi au ɔ̃ ɗɔn naa talim kɛ lɛsinɛ, Ɗalapa au yuu yɛ mariu wɛrɛtɔ a kolapani u ɔ̃rɛ aɗɔn, wɛrɛ gbete maa ayuu yɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ dangdang. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Dɔdɔrim u sɨntɛ au sisɨn nɛ, pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛ̃niba u kasirɛ u wɛrɛ gbete a a kolapa shɔu tosiu a bi naa fãrã; <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />na shɔkɛ tosiu fãrãu nɛ a bi, shɔ yɛ zɛu tɔkɨn naa u biwaati ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />aɗagbete ukɛ ɔ̃nɛ a bi kotipim, u sɨntɔ aru raa gbete u ɓooyɛ; ɓanɛ aru u kasi vɔsinɛ au jazɛ bi kotipimkɔni ɓa, ama u kasirɛ shɔu tosiu bi shɔ kolapa a bi, nɔgbete bi gbete u suru aɗɔn u kɔsi shɔgbete yɛ vɔyɛtɔ dangdang. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Ɗalapa au yuu ukɔ masiubiirɛ aru kɔsinɛnni, a ãu u suru aru u tasiunɛ nyamasinɛ ɓa a vigbete yɛ pɛliu a ɗekɨn yɛ.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Aru nankɔ kopileepiya u sisɨn manɛ aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, u zɛ tɛtɔ u bi kotipim kɛ ɔ̃nɛ dɔni, u kpɛlɛ a Uɓeyelapa wɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Aruviya u ɔ̃nɛ pɛ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ, ama ɓa shɔ jazɛnɔda ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />U sisɨn manɛ aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, u kasirɛ u yaau wɛrɛ a jazɛbiimtɔ, u ɔ̃ a Uɓeyelapani a kolapa. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ama vi pɛ̃niba ukɔ ɔrɛ shɔm, u kasirɛ u nta binyatɔ̃nɛtɔ, ko au wɛrɛ kotipim ko a kolapa. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Aruviya ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u shi a Kirisi ɗekɨn, aru u yeeruu ayuu. Kopiya yɛ kpaa ji vi shonɛ gbete pɛliyɛ, ji ko iviya au pɛliyɛ au bi kotipimkɔ, tɔ̃vɨn ko kɔ̃linɛ.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A Kirisi Kabii a Sã wesatɔ a Ɗalapani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Aru u zɛ vigbete a shɔ ɓaanɛ Uɓeyelapa seti ntanɛ tɛttɔyɛ, ukɔ sɨnrɛ u ɗɔgbete u maabii u gɔ̃ shɔ gãsiyirɛ. Ɗalapa zɛu tɛttɔ piti kpai nɔgbete u ɔ̃yɛni, ang kasinɛ ɔkɔma ɔ zɛtɔ a sisɨnni nizɛ nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ piya. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Ɓanɛ u kasinɛ u bɛliu yuu awɔ ɗekɨn ni ɓa; ama u kasirɛ u gelɔɔ ruu aru ɔ ntaubiinyatɔ̃nɛ, nɔgbete ɔ zɛnɔɔ shɔgbete i ɗeyuu i nya kasinɛyɛ, ama ɓa nɔgbeteyi sisɨn ɔ̃yɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />U pɛ rãngkɔ nizɛ ya? u kɛ ɔ̃nɛ rãng u pɛli aru Ɗalapa nii bassinɛ, ko u ɓa rãng ɓa ya? shɔmpɛ awɔ ruu yuu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />U vi pɛlinɛ kpai Kirisi ɔrinɛ ukɔ tesiu ɗekɨn rɛ, aruviya u ãsisɨntɛ nɛ Kirisi vɔ a shɔzɛ yuu piti kpai, aru nankɔ ko-piya vɔtɛ awuni. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Kirisi vɔ a shɔ yuu piti kpai, aruviya shɔ gbeteyi a suruni, ikɔyi ɔ̃nɛ, ɔ̃nɛ gbeteyi ɔriyɛ ɓa ama i ɔ̃ aru shɔgbete vɔrɛ a yuurɛ a suruni ai yuu.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Sãnɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn ukɔu yeeri shɔwɔ ruunɛ yuu naa shɔ kotipiyi yeeyɛni ɓa, aru nankɔ ɔ tuu Kirisi si tɛttɔ a nyabangkɔ ama dɔdɔrim ɔ tuu tɔkɨn nankɔni ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ko-piya kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a Kirisini u pɛ shɔzɛ sɔɔ; vi gbaali tɛɛtɛ gboti, u sɔɔ akɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Vim piti kpai Ɗalapa pɛlirɛ, shɔgbete a nyaba Kirisi kabii kɔsiutɛ au shɔnɔpɔ̃m anɛ u ɓɛusayi, a lɔurɛ nɛu pɔ̃ shɔwɔyi sɔ̃njo i ɔ̃ u ɓɛusa. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />U ruu gbete u geli shɔyɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa ɓasi shɔzɛtɛ kpai a Kirisi kabiikɔ. Ɗalapa ji gai ruuvini ɓa. Ɗalapa ãu naatɛ aru u ɓasi shɔtɔ awuni.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Nkɔu yɛm, ukɔu ɔ̃rɛ Kirisi janɔ, ji nagbete Ɗalapa au yuu nwanya au kabiiyɛ. U gaki a Kirisi yuu: Ɗalapa ɔ kɔsi sisɨntɔ ɔ ɔ̃ ɓeusayi, ama ɓau shɔnɔpɔ̃yi ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Kirisi u si ɓa a ruuvini ɓa, ama au yuukɔ Ɗalapa pɔ̃urɛ a vɔ au yuu ruuvinikɔ, aru u kpaa Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Au vishonɛ a Ɗalapani, u gaki wɔtɔ, ɔ shɔgbete ɔ kpaa Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛnkɔ, ɔkɔɔ yaanɛ u ɔ lɛsi weze. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ɔ nta vigbete Ɗalapa shayɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;&lt;Ang ɗa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">N weshotɔ awɔ nyani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">A lee gbete n ɗa shɔraanɛ a yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">n pɔ̃sɔɔnaatɔ.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Ɔ weshopɛ! Shɔm ɗagbete ɔ kpaa Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛkɔ, nɛm pɛ lee gbete n yɛ raawɔyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />U ji kasi ɓa shɔwɔɔ u kpaa yukɔnɛrɛ au vishonɛni ɓa, aru nankɔ u ji kasi ɓa u ɔ̃ shɔwɔɔ tari dɔkɔnɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Ama a vigbete u pɛliyɛ kpai u tasitɔ nɛ u pɛ Ɗalapa jawɛrɛyi, a nyaba sisɨnmɛɛnɛ a ɗaa yukɔnɛ, a ɗaa raɓoonɛ, a ɗaa ratasinɛ, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Shɔ wautɛ, shɔ pɔ̃utɛ a jahm, shɔ ntariu nɔrɔ vɔrɔtɛ, u pɛli vishonɛ gbete tɛu kakatɛ, u ji kpaa nɔrɔ roonɛ ɓa ko vishaanɛ shaanɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Ukɛ ɔ̃nɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ, a vizɛnɛ, a sisɨnmɛɛnɛ, a tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛni, u tasitɛ nɛu pɛ Ɗalapa jawɛrɛyi a nyaba Ɗa suru a ɔrinɛ nizɛni, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />au nyaba gbete u geli shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨnyɛ, a Ɗalapa kakani, u tɔ̃vɨn aka nakɨn ni gbete u yɛ waaba a wuniyɛ, gbete aka nagang u raau yuu awuni. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Shɔ basiutɛ, shɔ ãu yusẽtɛ, shɔ dãutɛ, shɔ bɛliu sɔ̃ntɛ, shɔ tuu naa shɔ nyayelinɛyi, a shɔmni kpai u sha ruu tɔ̃vɨntɔ; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />naa shɔ ji zɛu nii ɓa, ama shɔ zɛu nii tɛttɔ kpai; naa siu vɔ tɛttɔ ama naa ɔ zɛ yɛ u a suruni. Shɔ tasiu raattɛtɔ ama shɔ ji nyou vɔrɔ ɓa; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />ko u a yɛti sisɨn lɛsinɛ, kopiɗaviya u a sisɨn puruni; shɔ zɛu naa shɔraayi ama u pɔ̃ shɔ waanɛ i ɔ̃ shɔvinaayi; shɔ zɛu naa u vi ɓa, a shɔmni u vi aɗɔn piti kpai.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />N shɔbii ɔrinɛ Koranti! U nwanyatɛ ɔkɔɔni u ji ɓusɔɔ viwɔɔ ɓa, u ɓelɔɔ sisɨn tɛttɔ kpai. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />U tasɔɔ ɔrinɛtɛ a sisɨn; ama ɔ ji tasiu ɔrinɛ ɓɛɛjo ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />N nwanya dɔdɔrim a ɔkɔɔni naa ɔ pɛ majaayiː ɔ tasiu ji ɔrinɛ gbete u tasɔɔyɛ, ɔ ɓelɔɔ sisɨntɔ gbolo-gbolo au biini!<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkɔɔ Ɓasi Yuunɛ a Shɔgbete i ji Ãsisɨn Ɓa a Ɗalapa biini ɓa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ɔkɔɔ ɓasi yuunɛ a shɔgbeteyi i ji ã sisɨn ɓa Ɗabiini ɓa, aruviya shɔ tɔ̃vɨn a shɔ kɔ̃linɛni i ɔ̃ ɓa ɗɔgbeteni ɓa. Ko Ɗɔsẽsẽ a ɗɔkɨnrini i ɓasi ɓa a nyazɔni ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Kirisi a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ni i nya yɛ ɔ̃ kati gbete niya? Ivi ɓasi shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨntɛ a Ɗabii a shɔ gbeteyi i ji ãsisɨn ɓa Ɗabiini ɓa viya? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Ivi ɓasi wɛrɛ Ɗa vi a vigãngkini viya? Aruviya ukɔu ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa gbete u suru aɗɔnyɛ wɛrɛ! Ji na gbete Ɗalapa au yuu shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">&lt;&lt;N yɛn tɔ̃rin wɛrɛ ang shɔbiiyini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">n ɔ̃ ayini nyazɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">n yɛn ɔ̃ i Ɗalapa, i yɛ ɔ̃ n shɔbiiyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Aru nankɔ Uɓeyelapa shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">&lt;&lt;Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɔ yaayi ɗɔbiitɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ɔ vawɔ yuutɔ ai tetteni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">ɔkɔɔ pɛli vigbete ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ɓanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">n yɛn tɛwɔ naatɔ.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />N yɛn ɔ̃ ɔ ɓeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">ɔ yɛ ɔ̃ sɔ̃njo n javɔshɔ a jasoroyini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Uɓeyelapa shɔ gbete vitɛu kaka ɓa ukɔ sharɛ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />N shɔbiiyi n shɔ ɔrinɛyi shɔ ma ruumjo au yuukɔ. U sɔɔu yuutɔ a vigbete yɛ pɔ̃rɛ u bi yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔni ɓa, ko vigbete pɔ̃u suru yɛ ɔ̃ ɓa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔni ɓa, u ɔ̃ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a ɓuzɨn Ɗalapa gɨnnɛ.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Sisɨn Puru Ntanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Ɔ tasiu ɔrinɛtɔ awɔ sisɨnni, u ji pɛli shɔwɔ ruuvini ɓa, u ji lɛsi shɔwɔ nii ɓa, ko u kuli shɔwɔɔyi nɔɔrɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />N ji sha vim ɓa aru n yerɔɔ ruu ayuu ɓa, nagbete n gelɔɔ siyɛ, ɔ pɛ u shɔ ɔrinɛyi, viwɔɔ yɛ vɔsiu ɓa a ɔkɔɔni ɓa ko u ɔ̃tɔ suruni ko u vɔtɔ. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />N zɛ wɔ tɛtɔ; n baasitɛtɔ awɔ yuuni fɛ̃ɛmǃ Piti au raɓoonɛni kpai n sisɨn manɛ dooɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm; n ɗɔgbete n nta sisɨn puru waanɛ.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Ko akɨnti gbete u to Makidoniyayɛ u ji kpaa susunɛ ɓa. Raɓoonɛ siɗɔn kopiɗɔpiya a nyamarinɛ a zɔɔni, u nta setitɔ au sisɨnni. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ama Ɗalapa gbete masi shɔ gbeteyi sisɨn shɛtɛ a vini yɛ, masiu sisɨntɛ a Titu a nɛni. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Ɓanɛ au ruu anɛkɔ masiubiirɛ sheeli ɓa, ama wɔsɔ̃n ruu gbete geliuyɛ nɔgbete ɔ masiu biiyɛ, a geliu nɔgbete ɔ kasin zɛnɛyɛ, a nɔgbete ɔ sisɨn lɛsirɛ fɛ̃ɛm a vigbete a ɗɔɔ yɛnɛ ang yuuyɛ, nɔgbete ɔ mabii nɛi shi ang kɨntiyɛ; dɔdɔrim vimkɔ pɔ̃rɛ n nta sisɨn purutɛ fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ko n sẽkoo gbete n beeyɛ lɛsɔɔ sisɨntɔ, n ji yɔɔrinyuu ɓa, yɛm n si gakɔɔtɔ aru gbete ɔ sisɨn lɛsiyɛni, ama n zɛrɛ ɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛu yɛ yɛ kpɛlɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ama dɔdɔrim n nta sisɨn purutɛ, ɓa ruu gbete n lɛsɔɔ sisɨnyɛ ɓa, ama aru ɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛ pɔ̃ɔtɛ ɔ kɔsi sisɨntɛ ɔ yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛtɛ. Ɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛ wakɔ Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ, aru nankɔ u ji lɛsɔɔ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Aru sisɨn lɛsinɛ gbete Ɗalapa pɔ̃yɛ ukɔ pɔ̃ shɔrɛ shɔu kɔsi sisɨn u yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛ u kpaa naraanɛrɛ, a nankɔ n ji yɔɔri yuu ɓa ɗɔmɓa! Ama sisɨn lɛsinɛ gbete shɛ a kotipi ukɔ n ti vɔnɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Kɨnnɔɔ pɛ ɔ zɛ vigbete Ɗalapa pɛli aru ɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛ pɛː pɔ̃wɔ ɔ bizasinɛ pɛlinɛtɛ, au tasinɛ ɔ ji pɛli ruuvini ɓa! pɔ̃rɛ ɔ tuu sisɨntɛ, pɔ̃tɛ ɔ nta setitɛ, pɔ̃rɛ ɔ sɨn sisɨntɛ, ɔ mabiitɛ. Pɔ̃rɛ ɔ mabiitɛ aru shɔu gɔ̃ shɔ gbeteyi pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ yusho! Nyabang ɔ tasɔɔ yuutɛ nɛi ji kasi ruukɔ̃linɛ ɓa a vi piti kpai.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />N bee sẽkoo wa, n ji bee ɓanɛ aru shɔ gbete pɛli ruukɔ̃linɛ ɓa, ko shɔ gbete shɔ pɛliu ruukɔ̃linɛyɛ ɓa, ama n bee aru n tasɔɔ wasa-wasa a Ɗalapa kabii nɔgbete ɔ ã sisɨn au biiyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Aruukɔ u kpaa bimanɛrɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Pɛɓa u bimanɛkɔ sheeli ɓa, nɔgbete Titusi arɛ kpau a sisɨn puru ntanɛni a nyaba gbete u pɔ̃siunaa a ɗɔn piti kpai yɛ! <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />N baasitɔ au ɗɔbii awɔ yuuni, ɔ ji ang yusẽ ɓa, koleepiya u gelɔɔ ruunizɛ, sɔ̃nji nyabankɔ u baasinɛ gbete u pɛli a Titusi yuu tasitɛ nɛ pɛ nizɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Aruukɔ Titusi ɔrinɛ gbete tasiuyɛ yɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn, naakɛ kpaa sisɨn nɛ a nɔgbete ɔ gɨu nyayɛni kpai, a nɔgbete ɔ tɛunaa, a seti a bizanɛni. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />N nta sisɨn purutɛ aru n pɔ̃ sisɨntɛ awɔ bi a vi piti kpai!<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Vimatinɛ a Kirisa i Vi Ãnɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />N shɔbiiyi a Kirisi u kasirɛ ɔ zɛ vigbete Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ pɛliyɛ atette shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabii a Makidoninya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />I ɓooraa tɛtɔ fɛ̃ɛm a raaɓoonɛ gbete ai kpai yuu a ɓuzɨnniyɛ; ama aru gbete i sisɨn puru bang pɔ̃yirɛ i pɛli shɔ wɔyi tɔ̃vɨn fɛ̃ɛm, ko piti nɔgbete i sepɛ shɔraa kpishikni. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />N zɛ tɛttɔ nizɛ i ãtɔ nɔgbete i vinaa sãyɛni, i ãrɛ tɛyi vinaatɔ, ɓa shɔwɔ pɔ̃yirɛ nɛi ãrɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />I gakiu rɛ nɛu pɔ̃siyinaa aru nɛyi kasirɛ i kpaiyuu jo atette shɔ gbeteyi pɔ̃si shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi naa a Yuhudiyani. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />I ãrɛ tɛɛ nɔgbete u pɔ̃ ãsisɨntɔ, i garɛ i ã yuu pɛ a Uɓeyelapa bi; kɛɗɔn a Ɗalapa naapɔ̃nɛni ai ãi yuu kɛkɨn au biini. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Arumkɔ u gaki Titurɛ, shɔgbete gaa vishonɛmyɛ, u yɛ ɗekɨn a vishonɛ vinaa ãnɛmni, aruviya u pɔ̃sɔɔnaa ɔ yisinya vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨntɔ. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Ama ji na gbete ɔ pɛlitɛ tɔ̃vɨn a vi piti kpainkɔ, ko sisɨn-anɛ, ko nyanwanɛ, a ruu zɛnɛni awɔ nyaba naapɔ̃nɛ, wɔsɔ̃n ɔrinɛ gbete ɔ tasiuyɛ. Arumkɔ u kasirɛ ɔ yɛ ɗekɨn a vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛni.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Vi gbete n sham n ji ãsɔɔ ɓa nyaɓa, ama n kasirɛ n tasi nɔgbete shɔwɔyi tasi bimanɛyɛ, ang kasirɛ n zɛ nɔgbete ɔ ɔrinɛ tɔ̃vɨn ɔ̃yɛ, <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Ɔ zɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u tɔ̃vɨn shonɛtɛ; a nɔgbete u si a vinaa ni kpai, a pɔ̃uyuurɛ u ɔ̃ shɔraa awɔ yuu, a nyaba u shɔraa ɔ̃nɛnkɔ u pɔ̃rɛ ɔ kpaa ko-iviya kpai a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />N kɔng nyashanɛ yɛm ayuu vigbete yɛ ɔrɔɔ tɔ̃vɨn dɔdɔrim ɔ yisinya vigbete ɔ gaa si saa wɔɔyɛ, ɔkɔɔ gaa rɛ, ɓa ãnɛkɔ sheeli ɓa ama ɔ sisɨn kasinɛ aru ãnɛ u ɔ̃ aɗɔn. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Dɔdɔrim ɔ yɛ ɗeknnɛ awuni, ɔ yisinya vishonɛtɔ a sisɨn gbete ɔ gaa yɛ, ɔ pɛli ji vi gbete ɔ kaka sãyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ɔ sisɨn vi ãnɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn, Ɗalapa nta tɔ̃vɨn ji aru ɔ ã vigbete awɔ wuniyɛ, ama ɓa aru vigbete ɔ ãyɛ gbete ɔ ɓa a wuniyɛ ɓa.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13-14" />Ɓanɛ n kasirɛn ã shɔwɔyi vi pɛlaa ang ãwɔ vi kpete-kpete a yuu ɓa, ama aru ɔ vi aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, pɛ vitɔ̃vɨng ɔ pɔ̃si shɔ gbeteyi ɓɛɛ ɓa naatɔ, kɛɗɔn a ɗagbete ɔ ɓɛɛ ɓayɛ i ɓɛɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, i yɛ pɔ̃sɔɔnaatɔ. Kɛ nyabamkɔ ko-iviya yɛ ɔ̃kɛ zaali. <verse eid="2CO 8:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Ji nagbete shɔ bee a Ɗanyaruubii nɛ, &lt;&lt;Shɔgbete toli vinaa waanɛ, ji ɔ̃riu ɓa ɓamɓa, a shɔgbete toli vinaa fɛ̃ɛ ji ɔriu ɓa fɛ̃ɛ ɓa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Titus au Shɔ Dɔranɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />U dɔ̃ri Ɗalapatɛ nɔgbete pɔ̃ Titus kasirɛ u pɔ̃sɔɔnaa, nagbete n kasiyɛ! <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Ji pɛli ɓa vigbete u kasiu pɛliyɛkɔ sheeli ɓa, ama ji au kasinɛ yɛ ɔ ɗɔbii nɔgbete pɔ̃ au sisɨnyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />U ɗɔu dɔ̃ u shɔbii shɔgbete shɔ sisɨnãnɛ i ɓassiutɔ fɛ̃ɛm, aru u vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn au nwa ruu tɔ̃vɨn yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Ɓa shɔnkɔ sheeli ɓa, shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii i lɔu tɛttɔ u ra a ukɔni ayuu vishonɛ ɔrinɛ gbete u pɛliyɛ, aru u bassi Uɓeyelapa nii, sɔ̃n aru u tasinɛ u sisɨn naapɔ̃sinɛ aɗɔn.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />U ntasetɔ aru nɔgbete u yɛ gɨn a vinaa gbete shɔ ãu a shɔ kasinɛni. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Au sisɨn u kasi vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ, ɓa Uɓeyelapa ɗekɨnkɔ sheeli ɓa, ama a shɔzɛ ɗekɨn piti kpai.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />U ɗɔu dɔ̃ u shɔbiiyi ayikɔni a nyazɔɔ; shɔ gbete u ntau sisɨn tɛttɔ, u zɛu tɛttɔ ayuu vitɔttɔt u kpaarɛ u sisɨn shɔ naapɔ̃sinɛ aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm. Dɔdɔrim u sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ aa yuu yɛ ɗekntɛ fɛ̃ɛm, kasitɛ waanɛ u pɔ̃si shɔ naarɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Ɔ zɛtɛ Titus ɓɛɛ shɔgbete n pɛli vishonɛ a wuniyɛ aru u pɔ̃sɔɔnaayɛ, u shɔbii gãsiyi gbeteyi yɛ awuni nyazɔɔ, i ɓɛɛ shɔgbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabii i jashonɛyi ai n ti Kirisi basinɛyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Ɔ tasiyi ɔ ɔrinɛtɔ, nɔgbete shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii i zɛkɨn nɛu nɔsisɨn waanɛ awɔ yuu pɛ nizɛ.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Naapɔ̃nɛ aru shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabiiyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ji ɔ̃ ɓa kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n beerɔɔ rɛ aru naapɔ̃sinɛ gbete shɔ pɛli shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗalapa bi a Yudiyani ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />N zɛ tɛttɔ ɔ sisɨn naapɔ̃nɛ aɗɔn, n bassi tɛttɔ a shɔ ɗekɨn a tipi Makidoniya awɔ yuuni. N geliyi nɛ,&lt;&lt;Ɔ shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Akaya ɔ mabii tɛttɔ a saa gbete tɛwa.&gt;&gt;Ɔ bimanɛ gbete ɔ wuniyɛ pɔ̃yitɛ i nisitɛ a nɔrɔni. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Dɔdɔrim n ɗɔgbete n sho shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabii, aruviya u baassinɛ gbete awɔ yuu aru ruum ukɔ ɔ̃nɛ weze ɓa. Ama ji nagbete n sha ɓamkɔ, ɔ ɔ̃ a bimanɛni awɔ vinaa pɔ̃nɛni. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Aru n kaanɛ a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii a Makidoniyani, n ji kasiɓa i kpaa ɔrɛ ɔ ji mabiiɓa ɓa, kɛ ɔ̃nɛ nankɔ, u yɛ ɓoo yusẽtɔ aru baasinɛ gbete u pɛli awɔ yuuni fɛ̃ɛm, ɓa nkɔng ɓoo yusẽrɛ sheeli ɓa piti a ɔkɔɔni! <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Arumkɔ n zɛrɛ pɛ tɔ̃vɨn n gaki shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabiimiyitɔ, i yɛ ang ɗekɨn i toli vi gbete ɔ marɛ nɛi ãyɛ, aru u kaanɛ u kpai ɗɔgbete, yɛ tasi kɛkɨn nɛ ɔ ã ji ɔ kasinɛni, ɓanɛ ɔ̃rɔɔ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ɓa.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ nɛ shɔgbete kɛ ɓaa zɔvinɛ fɛ̃ɛ yɛ yee visha ji pɛ̃tɛ̃rɛ̃; shɔgbete kɛ ɓa zɔvinɛ waanɛ yɛ yee visha ji bang. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Ko-piya u ã ji nɔgbete pɔ̃ au sisɨnyɛ, ɓa atette sisɨn lɛsinɛ ɓa ko shɔ pɔ̃a a kakabi ɓa; aruviya Ɗalapa ɔri shɔ gbete ã vi a sisɨn puruyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Ɗalapa zɛnɔtɔ u ãwɔ vigbete ɔ kasiyɛ waanɛ, aruviya ɔ kpaa vi gbete ɔ kasiyɛ kpai au tɛɛ namtɔ, aru ɔ pɛli vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">&lt;&lt;Ã shɔraa vitɔ fɛ̃ɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">U tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ ɔ̃ dangdang.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Ɗalapa shɔ gbeteu ã shɔ zɔvi shɔ ɓaayɛ, a vishaanɛni aru shaanɛ, yɛ ãwɔ zɔvitɔ ɔ ɓaarɛ gbete ɔ kasiyɛ piti kpai, ukɔ yɛ pɔ̃rɛ zɔviu barɛ, u pɔ̃rɛ ɔ naa ãnɛ gbete ɔ ãyɛ u sha fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Koleepiya yɛ tasɔɔ vɔɔ susãritɔ a vi piti kpai, aru ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ gbeteyi ã shɔ vi sisɨn gbete, nɔgbete shɔ waanɛ i yɛ dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa kɨn aru ɔ vi ãnɛ gbete i tɛ au naa. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Aruviya vishonɛ gbete ɔ pɛlinkɔ shori ɓa shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn Ɗabii vigbete i kasiyɛkɔ sheeli ɓa, ama pɔ̃rɛ shɔ waanɛ i yɛ ɗekɨn a Ɗalapa dɔ̃rinɛni. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Aru vishonɛn u vitasanɛ gbete au n-tiyɛ awɔ ruu yuuyɛ, shɔzɛ waanɛ i yɛ bassi Ɗalapa niitɔ aru ɔ yuurorinɛ a ruu tɔ̃vɨn Kirisi, awɔ vinaa gbete ɔ ã shɔyɛ a shɔ gãsiyini kpai. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />I yɛ gaki Ɗalapa tɔ awɔ yuuni aru vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn au tɛɛ kaka gbete Ɗalapa pɛlɔɔyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />U dɔ̃ri Ɗalapantɔ aru gbete ãu vi pɛ̃niba a nyayɛ sha viwɔ dɔɔɓa au yuuni ɓayɛ.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus Rau Vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Nkɔng Bulus n gakɔɔtɔ, shɔ gbete shɔ ɓang nɛ shɔ gbete u yulakinɛ ɓa na nkɛ ɔ̃nɛ ɔkɔɔniyɛ, ama n shɔlanɛ naa n ji ɔ̃ ɓa ɔkɔɔni ɓayɛ. Aru yuurorinɛ a Kirisi tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ, <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />n gakɔɔtɔ, n kaanɛ ɔkɔɔ pɔ̃nnɛ n ɔ̃ shɔlanɛ, aruviya ɔ zɛ tɛttɔ n yɛn bɔ̃ɔ̃ shɔgbete i tɔnɛ vi gbete n pɛliyɛ pɛ vikotipinkɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Pɛ nizɛ u ɔ̃nɛ a kotipikɔ, ama u ba gbete u waayɛ ɓa shɔ kotipi ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Viyaa au shovi shonɛ a wuniyɛ ɓa viyaa shɔ kotipim ɓa ama pɛ Ɗalapa viyaa gbete u kaka aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, gbete u pɛli vishonɛ awuni u lɛsi ɗɔ gbeteyi kaka aɗɔn, u lɛsi nyamasinɛ nyayeelinɛyi. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />U lɛsi ruu nyamasinɛ ko-pi shopiyatɔ, u lɛsi ko-iviyatɔ gbete zãri ruu Ɗalapa zɛnɛyɛ, u pɔ̃ kopiya u sisɨn u gɨn Kirisi nya-ãsinɛtɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Akɨnti gbete ɔ ã yuutɛ a Kirisi biini, kɛɗɔn u yɛ mabiitɔ u gɔ̃ kopiya yushoo shɔgbeteyi i ji gɨn Kirisi nyaɓayɛ.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Ɔ taanɔɔ a vigbete ɔ nɔɔ zɛyɛ. Shɔwɔyi kɛ tɔnɛyi pɛ Kirisi ɓɛɛyɛ, i lɛri pɛ ai sisɨn fɛ̃ɛm, i zɛtɔ nɛ ukɔuma u ji Kirisi ɓɛɛkɔ na gbete i pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />N yɛn ntayusẽ ɓa, n baasirɛ a kaka gbete Uɓeyelapa ãuyɛ aru gbete n pɔ̃rɛ ɔ barɛ, ɓanɛ aru n pɔ̃rɛ ɔ sãtirɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />N ji kasi ɓa ɔ zɛnaa n ãwɔ sẽti a yɛti sẽkoo gbete n beerɔɔ yɛ niɓa. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Aruviya shɔwɔ shanɛ&lt;&lt;Bulus sẽkooyi pɛ raɓoonɛ aɗɔn a kakani, ama na kɛ ɔ̃nɛ a ukɔni au yuu, u kaka ɓa, u nyanwanɛu ɓa viwɔɔ ɓa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔu zɛtɔ u vɔsinɛ ɓa atette vigbete u bee a sẽkoouni aɗagbete u ɓa ɗɔnni ɓayɛ, a vigbete u pɛliyɛ naa u nyazɔɔ a ɔkɔɔni.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />U ji tɔɓanɛ u tɛɛsiu yuu a shɔ gbeteyi zɛnaa i tɛɛ kopiyatɛni ɓa. shɔzɛ gbete ai tɛɛsiyi yuu a zɔni, i yeeruu ai yuu aru ɓɛɛ zɔɔyi ai nɔɔ, i ɓa shɔruu kpẽnɛ ɓaǃ <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ama au bi, u yɛ baasi ɓa a vigbete u kaka pɛlinɛ ɓa ɗɔniyɛ ɓa; u yɛ shijo a vishonɛ gbete Ɗalapa yeeriu nɛu pɛlikɔ sheeli, vimkɔ ɔ̃rɛ vishonɛ gbete awɔ teteyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />A sitɛɗɔkɔ ɔ nwanya ji a vishonɛ gbete Ɗalapa ãwɔkɔ sheeli, aru nankɔ aɗa gbete u awɔ ɗɔbii n ji tɛɛ vigbete Ɗalapa shayɛ ɓa aru u nwarɔɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨn a Kirisi ruubii. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />U ji baasi ɓa a shɔwɔyi vishonɛ gbeteyi pɛliyɛni ɓa aru u kpaari yuu ɓassinɛ ɓa. Ama au sisɨn ɔ kɛ yɛ ɗeknnɛ a sisɨn ãnɛni a Kirisi bi, u vishonɛ awɔ tete yɛ barɛ u yɛ ɗekɨnɗekɨn, kopiɗaviya yɛ shijo a vishonɛ gbete Ɗalapa yeeriukɔ sheeli. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />U yɛ nwari shɔ ruu tɔ̃vɨntɔ a tipi wɔni gbete au tɛɛ ɔ ɗɔbii tɛttɔyɛ, u yɛ baasi ɓa ayuu vishonɛ gbete shɔwɔyi pɛlitɛ gbotini ɓa.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Ama ji nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ,&lt;&lt;Shɔ gbeteu kɛ tɔnɛn baasitɔ ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ u baasi a vi gbete Uɓeyelapa pɛliyɛ.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Aruviya ɓa shɔgbete au bɛliu yuukɔ shɔ ãsisɨnrɛ au biini ɓa, ama see shɔ gbete Uɓeyelapa bɛliuyɛ shɔ ãsisɨnrɛ au biini.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus a Jashonɛ nyayeenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />N kasirɛ ɔ mɛɛ sisɨntɔ ang yuuni, ko n pɛli vi naa rang! n gakɔɔtɔ ɔ pɛlitɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />N kaagɨntɔ awɔ yuuni nagbete Ɗalapa pɛliyɛ; ɔ pɛ naa nyara wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gbete n ma au yuu aru u tɛ vɔshɔ gbete sheeli, kɛ Kirisi au yuu. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ama n ntaseti vigbete kpaa Hawawu yɛ, yɛ kpaawɔɔrɛ tɔkɨn ɔ yaa yuu-ãnɛ a sisɨn gbete a Kirisi binirɛ. Sɔɔ shovi au ruu kpɛ̃nɛni a ɗakiurɛ a pɛli ruuvinirɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Shɔwɔ kaanɛ awɔ ɗɔbii ɔ tɛunaa weze ɓɛɛli ko nwarɔɔ ruu Yesɔ wɔ toti, ɓa shɔ gbete u nwanya au yuuninkɔ ɓa; a tete suru wɔ toti, ɓa ruu tɔ̃vɨn shɔ gbete ɔ tɛ si au naayɛ ɓa!<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />N ji pɔ̃ɓa ang sisɨnni nɛ shɔ gbete ɔ ɓainɛ &lt;&lt;Jashonɛ&gt;&gt; pɛ̃niba nɛi tɛntɛ a viwɔni ɓa! <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Wɔɓa shɔ ji matin ɓa nɛn ɔ̃ shɔ nyanwanɛ a shɔ ɗekɨn ɓa, ama n zɛ ruutɔ, u tasɔɔ tɛttɔ a nyaba tot-tot kopiɗaviya.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />N nwarɔɔ Ɗalapa ruu tɔ̃vɨn n ji kã ɓa viwɔ ɓa awɔ naani ɓa; n roorin yuutɔ aru n pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ tɔ̃vɨn, ɔ̃kɛtɛ ruuvini ang biini ya? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />A ɗagbete n si aɗɔ vishonɛ awɔ teteyɛ shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ wɔɔyi i shorintɔ. Ɔ̃kɛ naa n raavi a shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛ wɔyi naa n pɛlɔɔ vishonɛ awuni ya? <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />A ɗagbete n ɔkɔɔni nyazɔɔ n vi pɛlinɛ siɗɔn a saani n ji yɔrɔɔnya ɓa; Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii shɔ gbeteyi shɛ a Makidiniya i n ti vigbete n kasiyɛtɔ kpai. Ji nagbete si tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛyɛ, yɛ ɔ̃ ji nankɔ yɛnɛ ɗekɨn n yɛn yɔrɔɔ nyaba! <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Aru sisɨn ãnɛ Kirisi gbete ang sisɨnyɛ, n ma tɛttɔ shɔwɔ ɓa ko gbete auyɛ zãrin naa waanɛ a nɔsisɨn a tipi Akaya ni ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />N sha nankɔ aru n ji ɔrɔɔ ɓaya? Ɗalapa zɛ tɛttɔ n ɔrɔɔtɛ!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />N yɛn yɛ ɗekɨn a vishonɛ gbete n aɗɔ pɛlinɛ dɔddɔrimni, aruviya pɛlinɛ nankɔ yɛ pɔ̃rɛ jashonɛ wɔyi i yɛ kpaa nyaba baasinɛrɛ a shanɛni nɛi shovi na gbete u pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Jamiyi ɓa jashonɛ tɔ̃vɨn ɓa, i pɛ jashonɛ nyalinɛyi, ama pɛ shɔ vishonɛ nyayeelinɛyi. I tasiyi yuu naa Kirisi jashonɛyi. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ɓa vinɔlusinɛ ɓa! Ko japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ au yuu ma yɛ kɔsiu yuutɔ, u tasi naa u pɛ Ɗajashonɛlapa ɗɔsẽsẽ! <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Aru nankɔ ɓa vinɔlusinɛ ɓa naa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ jawɛrɛyi ikɛ kɔsiyi yuunɛ naa jawɛrɛ shɔ vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ. A kɨnti ni i yɛ kpaa ji vishonɛ gbete i pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus Raɓoonɛ au Vishonɛ Jashonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />N pasipɛtɔt: shɔwɔkɔ tɔnɛ nɛn rang. Ama ɔkɛ shanɛ nankɔ, ɔ mabii ɔ tuun ɓɛɛ ji naa rang, n kɔma n kpaa vi nɔsisɨn waanɛ pɛjo ko fɛ̃ɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Vi gbete n sha dɔdɔrinkɔ ɓa vigbete Uɓeyelapa shayɛ nɛn pɛli nankɔ ɓa; ama ruum tasitɛ nɛn nwanya ɓɛɛjo naa rãng. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ama shɔwɔyi aɗɔn ai waanaa a nɔsisɨn na gbete shɔzɛ kotipiyi waayɛ, n kɔma n waa pɛ jo ɗɔkɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ɔ ruukpɛ̃nɛ ɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm, ama ɔ tɛ rãng-yi naa a sisɨn nakazitiǃ <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Shɔ gbete pɔ̃rɛ nɛ ɔ ɔ̃ foo, ɔ mɛsisɨntɔ awuni, ko rawɔ-nyaba ko ɗasɔɔ tari, ko kasɔɔ kɨnti zɛnɛ, ko wawɔnaa a nɔkɨn. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />N ntayusẽtɔ n tɔnɛ u kaka ji yɛ nɔgbete u pɛli viwayirɛ ɓa!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ama naa shɔwɔ kɛ waanaa nɛ a nɔsisɨn aru viwɔ, n kɔma n yɛn waanaa ji a nɔsisɨn ni n pɛli nankɔ, aɗɔm n nyanwanɛ pɛ naa rãngkɔ! <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />I kɛ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ Ibiraniyawa, n kɔma n ji nankɔ. Ikɛ ɔ̃nɛ Shɔ Israilayi, n kɔma n ji nankɔ. Ikɛ ɔ̃nɛ Ibirayi shɔ laduruyi, n kɔma n ji nankɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />I kɛ Kirisi jawɛrɛyi ya? N nwanya naa rang, Ama in ɓɛɛ jawɛrɛ gbete tɛyi tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm! N pɛli vishonɛtɛ tɛyi ɓɛɛtɛ, n ɔ̃tɛ a jahmni fɛ̃ɛm, n ɓoo waanɛ tɛttɔ fɛ̃ɛm, n ranaa tɛttɔ a vɔrɔnyani waanɛ ko-piɗaviya. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Yahudawayi wang kpata bmati au jaa kopi a tu maanɛ ɓa maani; <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Yupɛ̃ni Romayi wang kpata ɓa taati; shɔ long a tari ɓa gbete, ɓa taati latosiyi sãkirɛ sɨn a ɓuzɨn kɔ, ang roo a mii niti niti, zɨng-zɨng a ɓuzɨn wapo, shɔ arɛ shɔ zɔ̃nkɨn. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ang nyaba rakinɛ n kpɛsitɔ a viyaani a mii a shɔ nyaba zɛnɛyini, n kpaan yuu a ɓuzɨn viyaa a mashɔzɛ ɗɔbii a shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i naa; n kpaan yuu a viyaa a komoo, n kpaan yuu a viyaa a jaalaa, n kpaan yuu a viyaa a wapo, n kpaan yuu a viyaa a bɔɔyi ɗɔbii wɔsɔ̃n n kpaa yuu a jashonɛ nyayeelinɛyi naa. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />N pɛli vishonɛ sẽnɛnɛ fɛ̃ɛm, n mɛɛsisɨn n ji roonɔrɔ ɓa; n nta nwotɔ a sutu miini; n ji kpaa vishaanɛ ɓa, n ji kpaa ɗɔronɛ ɓa a fãrã tosinɛni. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Ɓanɛ setɛn ɓali vigãsiyitɛ ɓa, kopileepiya kpai n ɓɛɛ ji ɗɔ gbete n yɔriyuu aru shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabiiyi yuu, <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Naa shɔwɔ kaka ji ɔ̃ ɓa, n kɔma n kaka ɔ̃ ɓa, naa shɔ kɛ pɔ̃ shɔwɔnɛ u pɛli ruuvini, n sisɨn lɛsitɔ fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Kɛ ɔ̃rinnɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n baasirɛ, n yɛn baasi pɛ ayuu vigbete tasinɛ n yɛn zɛnɔɔ pɛlinɛ dɔɔɓa. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Ɗalapa a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ ɓeye ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete shɔ bɛliu dangdang! Zɛ tɛttɔ n yeeɓa nyaɓa. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />A ɗagbete n si a Damasku gomna gbete a tipi kpati Aretas zẽ nyaɓa komoo aru nɛ shɔu sãntɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ama masayi ma rii raki i tosin a ɓuti i nɔsinrɛ a tipi komoo kaɓili, n ranaarɛ au naani.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus Nɔrinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ n baasitɔ, ko shɔ kpaa viwɔ ɓau yuuni ɓa. Ama dɔdɔrim n yɛn shavi ayuu vigbete Uɓeyelapa tasin a nɔrinɛ a vitasinɛni. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />N zɛ jaa Kirisa wɔɔ gbete u saa kopi atu maani nɛm, Ɗalapa tuurɛ yɛnɛ kolapa feemfeem, ko u si au bi shɔzɛ ya ko a suru ya Ɗalapa kɔ sheeli zɛrɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />N sha sɔ̃npɛ, n zɛ tɛttɔ jaam Ɗalapa tuurɛ yɛnɛ Ɗawɛrɛ, (toti, ko u si au bi shɔzɛ ya ko a suru ya n ji zɛ ɓa), <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />a ɗɔwakɔ nta ruu gbete shɔ sha dɔɔɓa a shɔzɛ nyakooni ɓa, a vigbete shɔzɛ gànya sha ɗɔɔɓa ni. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />N yɛn baasi a jam yuukɔ ama n yɛn baasi ɓa ang yuuni ɓa, see ayuu vigbete tasin nwesiyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />N si tɔnɛn kasi baasinɛ, n yɛn nwanya ɓa naa rãng ɓa, aru n yɛn geli shɔ vinizɛ. Ama n yɛn baasi ɓa, aru n ji kasi ɓa shɔwɔ u tunrɛ u tɛɛ nɔgbete zɛn vi pɛlinɛ ɓa, a nɔgbete nta vi ang nyayɛni ɓa.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Ama aru Ɗalapa ji kasi ɓa nɛn baasirɛ ayuu vinɔlusinɛ waanɛ gbete n zɛyɛni ɓa, a yanrɛ nɛn ɓoraa a vɔrɔ au kɔng a bishɔzɛ, vim ɔ̃kɛ naa japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ jashonɛ wanrɛ a zãrin yuu ɗenɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />N gaki Uɓeyelapa ɓa taati aru u vɔsintɔ a vimni, <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />ama u nyarisinɛ nɛ, &lt;&lt;N tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ ji vigbete a kasiyɛkɔ, aru n kaka ɔ̃ fɛ̃ɛm a ɗagbete a nwesiyɛkɔ&gt;&gt; n nta sisɨn purutɔ fɛ̃ɛm, n baasi ang ruu nwesinɛni, aru Kirisi u kaka shɔ kukinɛ u ɔ̃ a nkɔni. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Aru nankɔ n nta sisɨn purutɔ ang nwesinɛni, naa shɔ kɛ dãnnɛ, ko n kɛ ɓooranɛ, ratasinɛni a raɓoonɛni a Kirisi yuu. Naa n kaka ji ɔ̃ ɓa, a ɗaukɔ n kaka aɗɔn fɛ̃ɛm.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bulus yuuyɔrinɛ aru shɔ Korantiyayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />N pɛli vi naa rãng awɔ yuu, ama ɔkɔɔ pɔ̃ng-rɛ n pɛlirɛ. Tɔ̃rɛ ɔkɔɔ ɔ ɓɛlinjo. ko n ɓa viwɔ ɓa, ji tasi ɓanɛ ɔ &lt;&lt;Jashonɛ&gt;&gt; pɛ̃nibayi nɛi tɛntɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ɗalapa pɛli vibiizaanɛ a vinɔlusinɛni waanɛ awɔ ɗɔbii ang kabii, ang tete sisɨnmɛɛnɛ tasi tɛttɔ nɛn pɛ jashonɛkɔ nizɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Kɛ nyaba shɔpi n tasinɛ ɔ ɓa zali a shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi wɔyini ɓa viya? Ko kɛ aru gbete n zarɔɔrɛ ɔ pɔ̃sing naa ɓa a saani ɓaya? N gakɔɔtɔ ɔ yasin ruuvinintɔ naa n ji pɛli ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓayɛ!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Shom pɛ ɓa taati dɔdɔrim gbete n mabii n arɛ n ɗewɔrɛ, n yɛn pɔ̃ wɔ ɓanɛ ɔ ãng viwɔrɛ ɓa aru n kasi ji ɔkɔɔ, n ji kasi ɓa wɔ saa ɓa. Ji tɔ̃ ɓa jajayikɔ i nti ɓeye a ɓini ni viwɔrɛ ɓa, ama jaaɓeye a ɓini kɔ i nti jaayi vijo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />N yɛn nta sisɨn purutɔ n nyo vigbete n a wunini kpai, piti ang yuuni aru gbete n pɔ̃sɔɔnaa. N ɔrinɛ kɛ ɔ̃nɛ bang, kɛ ruviya ɔ ɔ̃rinkɛ fɛ̃ɛ viya?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Ɔ yɛ kasitɔ a vigbete n shayɛni, n tɛ saa ɓa awɔ naani ɓa. Ama shɔwɔ yɛ shanɛ n tasɔɔ ruu kpɛ̃nɛ, n ɗawɔtɛ a nyayeenɛni. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />N mɛwɔ kɛpikovi ya? A nyaba jashonɛ wɔ gbete n shou awɔ ɗɔbiini viya? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />N gaki Titus u yɛrɛ, n showɔ sɔ̃n shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii awuni. Ɔ yɛ shakɛnɛ Titus mɛwɔ tɛya? Nkɔng a ukɔɔni ɓa vigbete n-tiurɛ ɓaya? U gɨnɓa nyaba gbete ɓaya?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Ɔ pɔ̃ a sisɨn tɛ̃ɛ-tɛ̃ɛ nɛu kasiu yuu raanɛ awɔ ɗɔbiini, ɓa nankɔ ɓa! U sha vim naa Kirisi si shayɛ a Ɗalapa ɗekɨn, a vigbete u pɛliyɛ kpai, n shɔ ɔrinɛyi u pɛli aru gbete u pɔ̃sɔɔnaayɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />N ntaseti, naa n kɛ yɛ wɔ ɗɔbiinɛ n kpawɔ toti ɓa naa gbete n kasiyɛ ɓa, ko ɔ kpang toti ɓa naa gbete ɔ kasiyɛ ɓa. N ntaseti n kpawɔ a ɗɔ bawaanɛ, n kpawɔ a ɗɔ gɨnkaanɛ a zɔni, n kpawɔ ɔ aɗɔ sisɨntuunɛ a zɔni, a yuu kasinɛ, a zɔdãnɛ, a zɔ woonɛ, yuubasinɛ a bayusinɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />N ntaseti lewɔ n kaanɛ awɔ ɗɔbii n Ɗalapa yɛ pɔ̃ng-rɛ n ɓooyusẽrɛ awɔ ɗekɨn, n yɛn sɨntɔ aru shɔzɛ waanɛ gbeteyi pɛli ruuvini tɛ̃ɛ-tɛ̃ɛ, shɔ gbeteyi ji yaa ruuvini pɛlinɛ ɓa, ai pɛli kpatang zɔ kaanɛ roonɛ a soni a vɔshɔ gbete ɓai ɓɛɛɓa.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yushogɔ̃nɛ dangdang a Nyageenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Dɔdɔrim shomkɔ ɔ̃rɛ ɓa taati gbete n awɔ ɗɔbi n zɛwɔyɛ, &lt;&lt;Ko-pi ruu shɔpiya ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ shɔu nta ruu a shɔ ziti ko taati i nya gbeteyi shi a shɔ kɨntiyɛ&gt;&gt; ji naa gbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />N kasirɛ n geli shɔ gbeteyi pɛli ruuvini a kɨntiyɛ a shɔ gãsiyini kpai, n sha si tɛttɔ aɗagbete n awɔ ɗɔzɛnɛ ɓa zitiyɛ, ama dɔdɔrim n yɛn sha sɔ̃ntɔ ɗagbete n ɓa a ɔkɔɔni ɓayɛ, aɗa gbete nkɛ sɔɔnɛyɛ shɔwɔyɛ ranaa ɓa a yushogɔ̃nɛnni ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Ɔ yɛ zɛtɔ nɛ Kirisi nwanya ang kabiikɔ. Aɗagbete Kirisi pɛli vishonɛ a ɔkɔɔniyɛ, u kaka siɓa fɛ̃ɛ ɓa ama tasiu kaka tɔ fɛ̃ɛm awɔ tetteni; <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Pɛ nizɛ u kaka si fɛ̃ɛ naa shɔzɛ gãsi a ɗagbete shɔ ɓaunaa a laa a vɔrɛ, ama dɔdɔrim u a suruni aru Ɗalapa kaka. Au nyaba yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini u kaka ɓa ɗɔnni ɓa; ama a shomni kpai a ukɔɔni u kpaa surutɛ a nyaba Ɗalapa kaka vishonɛ au pɛli awɔ teteyɛ.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Ɔ teesɔɔ yuupɛ ɔ zɛrɛ ko ɔ ɔ̃nɛ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii a ɗɔnniya. Nyamasinɛ ɓa ɔ ji zɛ ɓanɛ Kirisi Yesɔ u ji awɔ sisɨnkɔ ɓaya? N ɓanɛ ɔ nwesi tɛttɔ gboti ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />N pɔ̃sisɨntɛ ɔ yɛ zɛtɔ nɛ Ɗalapa pɔ̃siunaa tɛttɔ au vishonɛni. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />U gaki Ɗa ɔkɔɔ pɛli vi gbete ɓa tɔ̃vɨn ɓanɛ, ɓa aru u kasiu yuu tasinɛ nɛ Ɗasharuutɛ ɓa, ama aru ɔ pɛli vigbete tɔ̃vɨnyɛ, ko shɔu zɛunaa u wɛ̃sitɔ. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Aru u gɨn ɓɛɛjo tɔ̃vɨn, ama u pɛli vi gbete masinya a wuniyɛ ɓa. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />U ntasisɨn purutɔ naa u kaka ji ɔ̃ ɓa, ama ɔ kaka aɗɔn. Shɔm vigbete u gaki Ɗa au yuukɔ ɔ ɔ̃ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Arumkɔ n bee sẽkoomrɛ simɓa a ɔkɔɔni ɗɔzɔɔ ɓa; ji nankɔ naa n kaanɛ n yɛn tasɔɔ raa ɓa n pɛli vishonɛ a Uɓeyelapa kaka gbete ãn-yɛni ɓa, pɛ kaka gbete mawɔyɛ, ɓa shɔ sãtinɛ ɓa.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Dɔdɔrim n yisinyatɛ, see lewɔɔ n shɔbiiyiǃ Ɔ mabiitɔ ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ; Ɔ wesho ang gaki nɛm, ɔ roo nntɔ a zɔni; ɔ ɔ̃ ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ. Ɗalapa shɔ shɔ ɔrinɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni yɛ ɔ̃tɔ a ɔkɔɔni.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ɔ gee zɔ nyatɔ a zɔ nakɔ̃tinɛ bii shɔ ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 13:12">Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi i gee ɔ nyatɛ kpai.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13-14" />Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ kirisi tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ, ɔrinɛ Ɗalapa, a Ɗa suru yuumusinɛ, i ɔ̃ a nyazɔ a ɔkɔɔni kpai.<verse eid="2CO 13:13-14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>